  "goodToKnow": "Konstatieren means to state or note a fact, a formal word in reports, essays and journalism: Experten konstatieren eine Zunahme der Fälle. The everyday word is feststellen. It suggests a sober, objective observation rather than an opinion. Like other -ieren verbs, it forms its perfect without ge-: hat konstatiert."
